Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:25.10,Title,0,0,0,0,,《哥斯拉大战金刚》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.52,0:00:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,骷髅岛的某个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.52,0:00:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 穿过高山 ∮ {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Over the mountain. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.52,0:00:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 越过大海 ∮ {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Across the sea. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.52,0:01:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 有一个女孩在等着我 ∮ {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ There's a girl She's waiting for me. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.52,0:01:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 淌过小河 ∮ {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Cross over the river. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.52,0:01:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 云海尽头 ∮ {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Beyond every cloud. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.52,0:01:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 她携风而来 ∮ {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ She's passed the wind. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.20,0:01:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 大声诉说 ∮ {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ That's blowing loud. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.52,0:01:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 翻过高山 ∮ {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Over the mountain. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.52,0:01:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一个女孩在等着我 ∮ {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ A girl waits for me. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.52,0:01:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 向流沙倾诉 ∮ {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Tell all the sands. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.52,0:01:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 每一片叶草 ∮ {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And every blade of grass. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.50,0:01:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 请让风传递我的爱 ∮ {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Please tell the wind to let my love pass. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.52,0:01:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 越过高山 ∮ {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Over the mountain. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.52,0:01:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一个女孩在等我 ∮ {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ A girl waits for me. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.84,0:03:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,警报 生物罩遭到破坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alert, biodome breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.97,0:03:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,警报 生物罩遭到破坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alert, biodome breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.22,0:03:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德鲁斯博士 你看到了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Andrews, did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.63,0:03:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,栖息地支撑不了多久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The habitat's not gonna hold much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.88,0:03:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得另外给它换个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to start thinking about off-site solutions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.84,0:03:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,骷髅岛是唯一让他与世隔绝的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The island is the one thing that's kept him isolated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.84,0:03:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这 哥斯拉会来找它的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he leaves, Godzilla will come for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.93,0:03:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,一山不容二虎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There can't be two alpha Titans.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.43,0:03:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在古神话中就誓不两立{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole theory of an ancient rivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.38,0:03:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,源于伊维族神话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}stems from Iwi mythology.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.93,0:03:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,它实在太大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gotten too big over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.34,0:03:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的环境维持不了多久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This environment won't sustain much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.18,0:03:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,太不稳定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.84,0:03:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.15,0:03:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,它很生气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.45,0:03:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去等我 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:04:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这就等于判了它死刑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off-site would be a death sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.01,0:04:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得一个王者会不知道怎么照顾好自己吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think the King could take care of himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.84,0:04:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有别的办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has to be another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.50,0:04:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,上古敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.05,0:04:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找这些生物的起源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finding the origin of these creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.05,0:04:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对人类的生存至关重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is essential to mankind's survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.09,0:04:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球内部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The interior of the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.72,0:04:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,由巨大的洞窟和气穴组成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is made up of vast cabins and air pockets,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.43,0:04:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,由天然通甬相连{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}joined by natural avenues.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.22,0:04:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军踏上了远征之旅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The admiral begins his expedition,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.59,0:04:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,探寻进入隐秘世界的入口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}searching for an entrance to a hidden world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.13,0:04:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,目的是发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The purpose is the discovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.80,0:04:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,并向世界揭开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the release to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.22,0:04:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,南极大陆那些未知的宝藏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the unknown treasures of Antarctica.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.43,0:04:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这将给人类带来巨大利益{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the interests of all mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.97,0:04:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也没人见过这些探险队员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Members of the lost party were never seen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.13,0:04:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁也不知道他们遭遇了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still no word on what may have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.43,0:04:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里的生态系统得天独厚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an ecosystem out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.26,0:04:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,远远超出了我们的想象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the likes of which we can't imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.68,0:05:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现它的地方就是这骷髅岛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the place to find it is this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.80,0:06:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,忠实的粉丝们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, loyal listeners.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.18,0:06:33.26,Title,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到《巨兽的真相》个人播客{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to TTP, Titan Truth Podcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.84,0:06:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,第245集{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Episode number 245.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.72,0:06:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today is the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.47,0:06:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是我录制的最后一期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the last podcast I ever record.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.43,0:06:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我上周也说过这话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And look, I know I said that last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.18,0:06:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,上上周或者更之前也说过这话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and maybe the week before and a few other times.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.09,0:06:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 关键是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, look, this is the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.68,0:06:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,在阿派克斯公司做了五年的卧底后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After five years of deep cover at Apex Cybernetics,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.51,0:06:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我终于要行动了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm finally taking my shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.84,0:06:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里正发生一些不好的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something bad is going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.01,0:06:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道到底是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.43,0:06:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要去寻找确凿的证据{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm about to walk in and download hard evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.84,0:06:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,揭露一个惊天动地的大阴谋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and expose a vast corporate conspiracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.43,0:06:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你可以叫我吹哨人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you can call me a whistleblower,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.05,0:07:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我这可不是吹吹口哨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I ain't just whistling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.51,0:07:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 这不是个小水花 这堪比泄洪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, this is more than a leak. It's a flood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.09,0:07:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 这场洪水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And believe me, this flood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.88,0:07:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,将揭露阿派克斯的所有谎言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is gonna wash away all of Apex's lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.05,0:07:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.47,0:07:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到阿派克斯控制区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Apex Cybernetics.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.09,0:07:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,未经授权的人员不得通过这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No unauthorized persons allowed beyond this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.72,0:07:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们创办阿派克斯控制的初心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we started Apex Cybernetics,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.55,0:07:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是以崭新的梦想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we dreamt of new ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.05,0:07:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助人类超越潜能的极限{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to push past the limits of human potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.47,0:07:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器人技术、人类思维、人工智能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robotics, the human mind, artificial intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.59,0:07:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道我们下一个梦想的新世界是什么样呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows what brave new future we'll dream of next?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.84,0:07:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是沃尔特·西蒙斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Walter Simmons,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.18,0:07:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,很荣幸能带领阿派克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it is my privilege to lead Apex.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.63,0:07:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈入人类新纪元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}into humanity's bold new era.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.26,0:07:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会离开你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.01,0:07:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不会离开我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And neither are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.93,0:07:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备开始吧 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.70,0:08:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,史密斯投了一个三分…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smith threw a three-point…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.76,0:08:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别吃那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't eat that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.26,0:08:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西很不健康{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's incredibly unhealthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.84,0:08:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是转基因产品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just all the GMOs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.09,0:08:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你想长第二个脑袋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Growing a second head could be useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.68,0:08:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得告诉我为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.76,0:08:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我 我自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because me, myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.13,0:08:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我这个脑袋已经不好使了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\r原文字幕}I can barely handle the one I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.76,0:08:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯尼 你不该来这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bernie, you're not supposed to be in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.80,0:08:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有想过我们在干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever wonder what we're really doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.59,0:08:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 在这里做的这些事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, really doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.18,0:08:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.59,0:08:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里不是工程部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't Engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.47,0:08:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 你知道 我在等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because, you know, I had to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.93,0:08:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他们打出新的工单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because they're rendering these new specs,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.84,0:08:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为需要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is gonna take over, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.09,0:08:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种计算模式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's calculator mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.51,0:08:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少一个小时 也许更久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…over one hour, maybe even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.22,0:08:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以工头让我出来走走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So my foreman told me to just take a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.84,0:08:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 交一些新朋友 - 哦.{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And make some new friends. - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.84,0:08:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 现在我们是新朋友了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Now that we're new friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.18,0:08:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该有福同享 对吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can share something with you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.01,0:08:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得带来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's in here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.63,0:08:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我做的洗手液{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is hand sanitizer that I made from my own garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.84,0:08:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's really amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.63,0:08:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忘了用过没{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know if I used that or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.38,0:08:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 这个 看看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. This. Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.97,0:08:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,右边这个 自组无线电台{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That right there is radio mesh networking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.72,0:08:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,带语音记录功能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a voice-record subprocessor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.47,0:09:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 猜猜哪弄的 - 我不关心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guess from where. Come on. - I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.84,0:09:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,烤箱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A toaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.63,0:09:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,烤箱上弄的 没想到吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's from a toaster. Look at this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.38,0:09:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去一下洗手间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.01,0:09:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,大号还是小号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it one or two?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.47,0:09:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果大号的话 就是苹果闹的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause if it's two, it's probably from these apples.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.13,0:09:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 要不要我配的洗手液{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you wanna use the hand sanitizer that I made?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.84,0:09:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.93,0:09:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我就待在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'll just stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.55,0:09:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.18,0:09:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 看看有什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.97,0:09:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.80,0:09:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,看屏幕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.80,0:09:30.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（货运舱单）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.43,0:09:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,要运什么到香港{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they shipping to Hong Kong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.01,0:09:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下33层有什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's Sublevel 33?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.63,0:09:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.84,0:09:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急疏散 泰坦警报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evacuation, Titan alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.51,0:09:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是演习{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.26,0:09:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体阿派克斯员工 紧急撤离…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All Apex employees, please proceed…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.22,0:09:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复一遍 紧急撤离{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is my cue. That's my cue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.47,0:09:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是演习{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.09,0:10:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,排成一队进入核辐射避难所{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proceed to the fallout shelter in a single-file line.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.84,0:10:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.43,0:10:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前他们用氰化物胶囊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They used cyanide capsules.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.05,0:10:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是什么辐射掩体来保守秘密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}instead of fallout shelters to keep the secrets in,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.59,0:10:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 你知道 这都不重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, you know, that's neither here nor there,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.09,0:10:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别听我胡说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so don't listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.76,0:10:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,二级人员进这里 快走 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Level two personnel, this way! Let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.76,0:10:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.63,0:10:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.38,0:10:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.80,0:11:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急撤离{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evacuate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.84,0:11:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间马上就到了 到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One level at a time, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.51,0:11:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 嘿 你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.51,0:11:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的身份识别卡呢 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's your clearance tag? - You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.51,0:11:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这节骨眼上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fact that you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.97,0:11:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要识别卡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}clearance tags right now in a time of crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.51,0:11:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也太不称职了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is incredibly unprofessional.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.13,0:11:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该讨论怎么疏散 明白我的意思吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be talking about evacuation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.05,0:11:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.97,0:11:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.51,0:12:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不 那是什么鬼东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.43,0:12:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是CNN特别新闻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is CNN breaking news.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.59,0:12:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国海军第四舰队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The United States Navy's Fourth Fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.51,0:12:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,立即开往东南沿海进行部署{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is deployed off the southeastern seaboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.51,0:12:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨夜遭到哥斯拉突然袭击后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the U.S. after last night's sudden Godzilla attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.68,0:12:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,一段和平时期结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A time of relative peace shattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.47,0:12:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨型泰坦怪兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the massive Titan,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.97,0:12:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾被视为人类英雄的巨兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}once thought to be a hero to humanity,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.55,0:12:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,在佛罗里达州彭萨科拉登陆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}made landfall in Pensacola, Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.76,0:12:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管损失已基本得到控制{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}While the damage was largely contained.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.63,0:12:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对阿派克斯美国总部而言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the U.S. headquarters of Apex Cybernetics,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.38,0:12:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界各国政府不会再冒任何风险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}governments around the world aren't taking any chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.18,0:12:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,从第一次证实泰坦巨兽目击事件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}after the first substantiated Titan sighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.38,0:12:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,距巨兽现身三年多来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in over three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.88,0:12:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,首席执行官沃尔特·西蒙斯表示{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}CEO Walter Simmons had this to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.05,0:12:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须通力合作确保这个世界更安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about working together to ensure a safer world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.01,0:12:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉是个巨大的威胁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godzilla's a threat to humanity,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.55,0:12:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,而阿派克斯有一个解决方案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Apex has a plan to deal with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.55,0:12:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以一劳永逸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.72,0:13:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体师生请注意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Students and faculty, please be advised.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.05,0:13:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,召开全校师生大会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a mandatory assembly will be held.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.72,0:13:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,于今天下午两点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at 2:00 p.m. this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.22,0:13:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,辅导员要在本周{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guidance counselors will also be holding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.76,0:13:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,针对个人或小组{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}additional office hours all this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.63,0:13:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行额外指导{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for individual and group sessions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.18,0:13:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎收听 忠实的粉丝们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back, loyal listeners,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.72,0:13:14.34,Title,0,0,0,0,,《巨兽真相》个人播客第246期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Titan Truth Podcast, episode 246.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.43,0:13:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天哪 我就在现场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.01,0:13:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉袭击阿派克斯的过程 我全看到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godzilla's Apex attack. I saw it go down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.80,0:13:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们以为它再次现身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it's a coincidence that he reappears.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.09,0:13:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧毁那个设施 都是巧合吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and just so happens to destroy that specific facility?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.80,0:13:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 这根本就不是巧合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha-ha, no, no, no, no. No such thing as coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.43,0:13:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 肯定有个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, I'm telling you, there's something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.18,0:13:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,看不见的东西在激怒他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}provoking him that we're not seeing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.97,0:13:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果附近没有其它巨兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why else would Godzilla flash an intimidation display.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.43,0:13:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉为什么要发光威胁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if there wasn't another Titan around?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.01,0:13:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个播客给你洗脑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That podcast is filling your head with garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.09,0:13:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你应该在学校待着 - 我只是想帮忙.{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You should be in school. - I am just trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.93,0:13:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要 我只希望你能平安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want you to help. I want you to stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.18,0:13:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想跟它们和平共处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We needed a plan to keep peace with these things,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.18,0:13:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之前最好的计划已经失效{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the best one we had just went down in flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.43,0:13:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我束手无策{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.09,0:13:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在唯一能做的就是为你担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the last thing that I need is to be worrying about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.09,0:13:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉救了我们 你和妈妈都在 你看到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godzilla saved us. You were there with Mom. You saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.43,0:14:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能怀疑它呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you doubt him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.80,0:14:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一定存在某种模式 - 不会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There has to be a pattern. - There doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.47,0:14:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它被激怒的 - 这不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A reason why he was provoked. - There isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.51,0:14:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.80,0:14:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为生物 就像人一样 是会变的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because creatures, like people, can change.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.76,0:14:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 哥斯拉就在外面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And right now, Godzilla's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.26,0:14:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在伤害人类 而我们却不知道原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's hurting people, and we don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.38,0:14:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我清静一下 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So cut your pop some slack, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.97,0:14:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 家里见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you at home, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.84,0:14:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,想听结论吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna know my theory?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.55,0:14:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 所以你们才在这里的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, of course you do. That's why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.38,0:14:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 这都是模式和变量造成的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, it's all about patterns and variables.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.88,0:14:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 等等 跟紧我 我带你回到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wait, stick with me. I'm gonna take you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.68,0:14:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,六年级学的知识 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to sixth grade with this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.47,0:14:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉被激怒就会展开攻击 这就是它的方式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godzilla attacks when provoked, that's the pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.97,0:14:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭萨科拉是沿海唯一的阿派克斯枢纽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pensacola is the only coastal Apex hub.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.68,0:14:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,先进的机器人阿派克斯中心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with an advanced robotics lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.93,0:14:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是变量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the variable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.26,0:14:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,二者加起来结论就是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And add them up and your answer is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.09,0:14:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿派克斯就是问题的核心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Apex is at the heart of the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.01,0:15:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.01,0:15:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,预约的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want an appointment,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.68,0:15:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作时间是朝九晚五{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}my office hours are nine to five.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.18,0:15:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托 林德博士 - 这他妈的是什么.{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please, Dr. Lind. - What the f…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.01,0:15:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你我这样的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys like you and me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.84,0:15:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的工作时间都不固定 是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we don't do normal hours, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.13,0:15:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直坚信有地底世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been fixated on Hollow Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.68,0:15:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for as long as you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.18,0:15:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这本关于巨兽起源的学说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your theory that it's the birthplace of all Titans.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.26,0:15:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人拍案叫绝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.55,0:15:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的书也给人留下了深刻的印象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your book was very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.59,0:15:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是吗 我公寓里还有三十箱滞销的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah? Well, I got about 30 unsold boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.55,0:15:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不想要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in my apartment if you want some.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.38,0:15:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔特·西蒙斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walt Simmons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.84,0:15:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识您 先生 很荣幸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who you are, sir. It's an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.22,0:15:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 荣幸的是 情况紧急{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the honor is mine. As is the urgency.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.88,0:15:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉之前从未无缘无故地攻击过我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godzilla has never attacked us unprovoked before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.26,0:15:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间迫在眉睫 林德博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are dangerous times, Dr. Lind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.26,0:15:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,请允许我介绍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me to introduce.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.72,0:15:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿派克斯首席技术官 芹泽莲先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}our Apex chief technology officer, Mr. Ren Serizawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.51,0:15:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他手上有件非常有趣的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has an interesting thing to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.05,0:16:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的新卫星传送回来的磁成像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magnetic imaging from one of our new satellites.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.13,0:16:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这是什么 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what this is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.76,0:16:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,地底世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hollow Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.18,0:16:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,像海洋一样广阔的生态系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An ecosystem as vast as any ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.55,0:16:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在我们脚下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}right beneath our feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.09,0:16:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个能量信号十分巨大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This energy signal is enormous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.51,0:16:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,与哥斯拉的读数几乎相同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And almost identical to readings from Gojira.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.01,0:16:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的太阳为地球表面提供能量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As our sun fuels the planet's surface,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.84,0:16:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这种能量也维持着地底世界的运转{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this energy sustains the Hollow Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.72,0:16:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,滋养了我们强大而好斗的巨兽朋友 茁壮成长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}enabling life as powerful as our aggressive Titan friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.51,0:16:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能够驾驭这种生命力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can harness this life force,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.55,0:16:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就拥有了与哥斯拉抗衡的武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll have a weapon that can compete with Godzilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.22,0:16:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你帮我找到它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.84,0:16:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我是不是合适人选{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if I'm the right guy for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.18,0:16:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看过这些评论吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you read the reviews?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.59,0:16:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,“科幻小说骗子兜售的边缘物理学 ”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"A sci-fi quack trading in fringe physics."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.63,0:16:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧我的待遇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look where they put my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.26,0:16:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我住在地下室 对面就是长笛班{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in the basement right across from flute class.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.68,0:16:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 我已经离开帝王组织了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, I'm not with Monarch anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.47,0:17:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且地底世界是不可能进入的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Hollow Earth entry is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.59,0:17:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们试过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.59,0:17:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥的事我很遗憾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.63,0:17:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是一位真正的先驱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a true pioneer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.97,0:17:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.63,0:17:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,初步扫描结果显示{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, all of our forward scans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.01,0:17:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有一个宜居的环境{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}suggest a habitable environment down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.38,0:17:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你哥哥的任务到底出了什么问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what really went wrong on your brother's mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.76,0:17:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他们试图进入时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they tried to enter,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.63,0:17:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,遭遇了引力反转{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they hit a gravitational inversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.84,0:17:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,相当于整个地心引力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A whole planet's worth of gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一瞬间反转{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}reversed in a split second.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.68,0:17:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们瞬间就被压扁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were crushed in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.43,0:17:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我告诉你 我们阿派克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I told you that we, at Apex,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.01,0:17:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,创造了一种非凡的飞行器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}have created a phenomenal craft.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.18,0:17:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以承受这样的反转呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which could sustain such an inversion?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.51,0:18:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,“地底世界”空中飞行器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Hollow Earth Aerial Vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.63,0:18:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,地飞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}HEAV.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.93,0:18:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以踏上旅程{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can make the journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.05,0:18:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,能进入地底世界 林德博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Hollow Earth possible, Dr. Lind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.43,0:18:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们需要你来领导这项任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we need you to lead the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.63,0:18:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.51,0:18:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,也帮帮每个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.88,0:18:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这犹如大海捞针{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finding this needle in a haystack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.38,0:18:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也是我们对抗哥斯拉的最好机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is our best shot against Godzilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.72,0:18:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我 呃 曾经有个想法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I, uh, might have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.22,0:18:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是很疯狂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.55,0:18:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢疯狂的想法 能给我带来财富{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love crazy ideas. They made me rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.68,0:18:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们对遗传记忆熟悉吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you guys familiar with genetic memory?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.26,0:18:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种理论认为所有的泰坦巨兽都有相同的冲动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a theory that all Titans share a common impulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.13,0:18:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,追溯到进化的源头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to return to their evolutionary source.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.26,0:18:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像产卵的鲑鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like spawning salmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.68,0:18:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 或者回巢的鸽子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. Or a… Or a homing pigeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.97,0:18:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果这里是泰坦巨兽的家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if this is the Titans' home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.26,0:18:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且这种生命力维持着他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this life force sustains them…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.47,0:19:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰坦巨兽就可以给你指路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Titan could show you the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.97,0:19:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.05,0:19:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这得靠一位老同事的帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a little help of an old colleague.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.70,0:19:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh, where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.60,0:19:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德鲁斯博士 保安处有位访客在等你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Andrews, there's a visitor waiting for you at security.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.55,0:19:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.72,0:19:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.42,0:19:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.85,0:19:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.80,0:20:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能骗我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.60,0:20:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是小孩子了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.63,0:20:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,“地底世界”中的一种能量源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A power source in Hollow Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.80,0:20:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太荒唐了 内森 怎么你也信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This sounds nuts, Nathan, even for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.09,0:20:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真的 我们要金刚带我们进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's there! We just need Kong to bring us to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.09,0:20:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,金刚只要一离开隔离区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The second you take Kong out of containment,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.68,0:20:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉就会来找它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godzilla's gonna come for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.22,0:20:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过不能永远把它留在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you can't keep him here forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.70,0:20:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们的干涉已经严重破坏了栖息地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Our meddling has already wreaked havoc on Kong's habitat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.01,0:20:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不会让你带走他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way am I letting you drag him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.51,0:20:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,横跨半个地球利用它当做武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}halfway across the world to use him as a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.22,0:20:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是当作武器 是当作盟友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not as a weapon. As an ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.68,0:20:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护我们 带我们到下面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To protect us, lead the way down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.84,0:20:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你凭什么认为他愿意下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What even makes you think that he'll go in?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.09,0:20:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直相信骷髅岛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always believed that Skull Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.88,0:20:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是地底世界浮出了地表 对吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was like Hollow Earth come to the surface, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.38,0:20:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是金刚祖先的发源地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's where Kong's ancestors came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.22,0:20:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯-嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.43,0:20:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿过南极洲的入口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through the entrance in Antarctica,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.63,0:20:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以帮它找个新家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we could help him find a new home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.76,0:20:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,它也可以拯救我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he could save ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.51,0:20:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.97,0:20:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个能量源可能是唯一的希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That power source may be our only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.51,0:20:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得阻止哥斯拉 这是唯一的机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta stop Godzilla. This is our only chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.84,0:20:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须去试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.84,0:21:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.68,0:21:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但说到金刚 具体行动必须听我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when it comes to Kong, what I say goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.88,0:21:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,悉听尊便 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You name the terms. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.68,0:21:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.22,0:21:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会后悔的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't regret this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.72,0:21:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我已经后悔了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, I already regret this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.90,0:21:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他的家
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.80,0:21:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.70,0:21:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的家…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.90,0:21:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.70,0:21:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.72,0:21:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.52,0:22:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 若你现在能见到我 ∮ {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ If you could see me now. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.52,0:22:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 那个宁愿漂泊 ∮ {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The one who said that he'd rather roam. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.52,0:22:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 那个宁愿孤独 ∮ {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The one who said he'd rather be alone. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.52,0:22:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 多想你现在能见到我 ∮ {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ If you could only see me now. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.52,0:22:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我在风中久驻 ∮ {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I've been too long in the wind. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.52,0:22:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 亦在雨中漫步 ∮ {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Too long in the rain. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.52,0:22:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 愿尽余生慰藉你 ∮ {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Taking any comfort that I can. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.52,0:22:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 往事不再回首 ∮ {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Looking back and longing for. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.52,0:22:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 挣脱枷锁 奔向自由…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ The freedom of my chains… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.26,0:22:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦 天啊 在这都能闻到它的味道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo! Jeez, I can smell him from up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.76,0:22:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,它也能闻到你的味道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he can smell you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.93,0:23:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定不是它的粉丝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still not a fan, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.22,0:23:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.51,0:23:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's she saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.72,0:23:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个伊维族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just an Iwi expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.84,0:23:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,意味着你很勇敢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means that you're very brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.01,0:23:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 嗯哼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.38,0:23:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 给它少用点镇静剂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, use a light touch on the sedatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.76,0:23:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,它可是护卫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's our escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.84,0:23:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们到了地底世界，它可不能昏昏沉沉的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't have him comatose when we reach Hollow Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.59,0:23:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果金刚不愿意去呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if Kong doesn't go willingly?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.68,0:23:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时你会怎么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you do then?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.51,0:23:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,林德博士 请来报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Lind, please report.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.01,0:23:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,到前甲板来 林德博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the forward deck. Dr. Lind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.09,0:23:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.80,0:23:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,新来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}New arrivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.09,0:23:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.84,0:24:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.01,0:24:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 哪个白痴想出的这个主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Who's the idiot who came up with this idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.05,0:24:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈哈 - 我是玛娅·西蒙斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ha-ha. - I'm Maia Simmons.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.88,0:24:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲派我来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father sent me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.01,0:24:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是阿派克斯派驻代表{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I run point for Apex.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.55,0:24:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,内森·林德 这次任务的负责人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nathan Lind, mission chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.72,0:24:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 别担心 我就是个保姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, don't worry. I'm just here to babysit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.84,0:24:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,地底世界飞行器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Hollow Earth Aerial Vehicles.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.93,0:24:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经在运往南极的路上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}are on their way to Antarctica as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.26,0:24:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们认为自己的技术很尖端{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you people think you're cutting-edge,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.72,0:24:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是跟我们借给你的原型机相比{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but these prototypes we're loaning you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.43,0:24:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直就是老掉牙的米亚塔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will make what you've been flying look like used Miatas.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.97,0:24:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢米亚塔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love Miatas.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.55,0:24:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别考虑价钱 反正高得吓人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget about the price tag, which is obscene, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.76,0:24:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,光反重力引擎产生的电荷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The antigravity engines alone produce.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.55,0:24:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,就足够拉斯维加斯亮一周了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}enough charge to light up Vegas for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.26,0:24:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,长长见识吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel free to be impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.09,0:24:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.09,0:25:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们将在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.43,0:25:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,48小时内到达南极入口处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the Antarctica entry in 48 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.47,0:25:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条路会把我们带到地底世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This path will get us into Hollow Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.63,0:25:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去以后 金刚就会带我们找到能量源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we're inside, Kong should lead us to the power source.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.40,0:25:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时 反向重力会让身体异常难受{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the gravitational inversion will be quite intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.47,0:25:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的猜测大概是在进入时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our best guess is that on entry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.93,0:25:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉就像蹦极一样…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll feel like bungee jumping…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.01,0:25:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像用绳子拽着你的肠子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the cord tied to your lower intestine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.26,0:25:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 如果直升机如你夸的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if your helicopters are as good as you say…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.68,0:25:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,地底世界飞行器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}HEAVs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.97,0:25:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果地底世界飞行器真像你说的那么出色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your HEAVs are as good as you say they are,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.59,0:25:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信我们能做到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe we can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.84,0:25:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞行器没问题的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll do the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.51,0:25:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,干好你的就行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just gotta do yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.63,0:25:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.50,0:25:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德鲁斯博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Andrews.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.40,0:25:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们避开了哥斯拉出现的所有水域{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've avoided all of Godzilla's known territorial waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.00,0:25:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,按照你的指南{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}according to your guidelines.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.80,0:25:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.80,0:25:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要为此担心吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I need to be concerned?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.22,0:25:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 它们确实有办法感知威胁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. They do have a way of sensing threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.13,0:25:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们相信它们是世仇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we believe that they had an ancient rivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.68,0:25:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,神话中说他们的祖先{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The myths say that their ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.84,0:25:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经有过生死决战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}fought each other in a great war.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.84,0:25:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们再见面 就看谁屈服于谁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if they meet again, who bows to who, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.43,0:25:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我在骷髅岛上花了十年时间研究它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I spent 10 years on that island studying him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.13,0:26:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一点我很确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.84,0:26:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,金刚永远不会屈服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kong bows to no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.84,0:26:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可以去那里吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she supposed to be out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.88,0:28:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉雅 快走 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jia, come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.10,0:28:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.00,0:28:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面不安全
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.40,0:28:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,金刚很伤心
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.90,0:28:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,也很生气
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.60,0:28:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是因为他不理解
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.20,0:28:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是想帮他
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.20,0:28:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不相信
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.50,0:28:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.80,0:28:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他告诉我的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.40,0:28:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,家
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.50,0:28:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,家
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.93,0:28:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只猴子在说话吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did the monkey just talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.05,0:29:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 同学们 认真听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, class, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.84,0:29:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉在彭萨科拉港袭击阿派克斯的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the midst of Godzilla's attack on Apex Pensacola,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.01,0:29:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现一些疯狂的科技{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found some crazy tech with no official classification.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.68,0:29:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们与我见过的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I saw doesn't match.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.18,0:29:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何工程规格都不匹配{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}any of the engineering specs I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.97,0:29:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么他们秘密的停电下干什么 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are they working on in such blackout secrecy, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.43,0:29:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能是需要最终解开的线索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could be the thread that finally unravels.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.13,0:29:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿派克斯的阴谋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Apex sweater of conspiracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.84,0:29:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我会一直顺着线索逐渐展开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better believe I'm gonna keep tugging.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.63,0:29:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前 我是安全的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For now, I'm secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.05,0:29:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,在众目睽睽之下充当卧底{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anonymous and hiding in plain sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.55,0:29:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续我的任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}as I continue my mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.84,0:29:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听着 绝对不能让我哥知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be clear, my brother can never know we took his van.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.84,0:29:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔什 放心吧 即使我们出了车祸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Josh, to be clear, even if we got into an accident,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.22,0:29:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也看不出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he could tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.76,0:29:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我哥不许你开他的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, my brother would never let you drive either.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.63,0:29:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的任务 我掌握方向{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mission, my wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.84,0:29:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为这不是个好主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't think it's a good idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.84,0:29:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样去找网上神秘的怪胎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}looking for some secret weirdo off the Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.22,0:30:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 在学校大会上刚说过这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we just had an assembly about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.59,0:30:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是怪胎 他是个秘密调查员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not a weirdo. He's a covert investigator.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.01,0:30:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有他在寻找哥斯拉和阿派克斯的真相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's the only one looking for the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.01,0:30:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于哥斯拉和阿派克斯的真相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}about Godzilla and Apex.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.55,0:30:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就让他找好了 我们为什么要帮他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let him look. Why do we have to help him?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.26,0:30:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.59,0:30:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不做 其他人也不会这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't, nobody else will.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.84,0:30:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底来不来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you coming or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.47,0:30:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然要去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.51,0:30:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,门卡住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.84,0:30:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.43,0:30:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,精神控制 好好看看 绵羊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind control. Read up on it, sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.55,0:30:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵能链接技术已成为现实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Psionic link technology is a reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.26,0:30:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 一个大脑控制另一个大脑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. One brain controlling another.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.51,0:30:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.88,0:30:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,想象一下在全球范围内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine that on a global scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.97,0:30:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿派克斯公司是无敌的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Apex is invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.84,0:30:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经听这个怪胎唠哪好几个小时了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been listening to this weirdo for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.13,0:30:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 哇 哇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.05,0:30:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦 别捣乱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.22,0:30:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我跟你说过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, this is the part I was telling you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.13,0:30:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要特殊紫外线才能知道你已被标记{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…need special UV to even know you've been marked!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.18,0:30:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,一两加仑是去不掉的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One or two gallons won't cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.84,0:30:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要大量的漂白剂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need my bleach in bulk!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.63,0:31:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为间谍粉确有其事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because spy dust is real, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.76,0:31:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 拜托 肉眼看不见.{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, come on, invisible to the naked eye…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.47,0:31:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就就是找到他的线索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how we find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.18,0:31:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 漂白剂 - 漂白剂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The bleach. - Bleach?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.18,0:31:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要用到很多漂白剂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He consumes a ton of bleach.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.18,0:31:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他喝漂白剂吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He drinks bleach?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.68,0:31:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是用来沐浴的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Showers with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.13,0:31:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 是的 我也用漂白剂沐浴 不 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Yeah, I shower with bleach. No, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.01,0:31:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为了防范有机跟踪技术{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prevention against organic tracking technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.97,0:31:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了吗？间谍情报技术{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? Tradecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.47,0:31:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他喝了会更有意义{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would've made more sense if he just drank it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.72,0:31:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 就差一个地方了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, just one more place.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.68,0:31:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅蒂森 我已经没耐心了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madison, this is getting old.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.26,0:31:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 有漂白剂吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you sell bleach?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.63,0:31:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个也有网络挑战吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this another one of those Internet challenge things?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.84,0:31:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我卖洗衣球给那些小家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I sold those kids those detergent pods,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.63,0:31:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到他们给吃了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know they were gonna eat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.84,0:31:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,到现在官司还没了结呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still dealing with the lawsuits from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.68,0:31:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们在找一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we're looking for a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.09,0:31:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为阿派克斯公司工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who works for Apex Cybernetics.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.68,0:31:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,买大量漂白剂 每晚都买{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buys a lot of bleach. Like every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.59,0:31:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能是偏执狂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's probably paranoid,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.05,0:31:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,神经过敏 不喜欢阳光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}high-strung, doesn't like daylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.84,0:31:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 胡须上有很多面包渣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, has a lot of crumbs in his beard,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.47,0:31:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如他有胡子的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he has a beard.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.68,0:31:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,少废话 买不买糖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look, you kids want some candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.84,0:31:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,买糖我这有的是\{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I can help you with candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.05,0:32:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我的眼睛 好吧？我需要信息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me in the eye. Okay? I need information.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.38,0:32:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们想要很多糖果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we want lots of candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.63,0:32:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干吗呢 你觉得…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? You think…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.26,0:32:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你是说伯尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you mean Bernie.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.84,0:32:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我认识那个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.63,0:32:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他买了大量漂白剂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He buys, like, a ton of bleach.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.26,0:32:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道他在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where he is, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.76,0:32:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你买一条活鱼 我就给你他的地址{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you buy a live fish, I'll give you his address.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.09,0:32:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bernie?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.76,0:32:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生… 小姐…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mister…Mis…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.72,0:32:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯尼先生不在家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mister Bernie not home.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.13,0:32:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 那绝对是伯尼先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, that was definitely Mister Bernie.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.51,0:32:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 嗯…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.01,0:32:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 嗨 听着 我们想谈谈阿派克斯和哥斯拉的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi! Hi. Listen, we wanna talk about Apex and Godzilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.38,0:32:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.51,0:32:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我… 我拍到你的脸了 我会联系当局 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I got your faces. I contact authorities. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.38,0:32:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为敲门吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For knocking on a door?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.59,0:32:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.88,0:32:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯尼 你根本不信任当局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bernie, you don't trust the authorities.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.05,0:32:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫梅蒂森·拉塞尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Madison Russell.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.05,0:32:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲在帝王组织工作 我母亲是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father works for Monarch and my mother was…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.09,0:32:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾玛·罗素 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emma Russell, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.84,0:32:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在深聊之前 我先问个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before we go any farther, I got one question.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.76,0:33:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝不喝自来水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tap or no tap?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.84,0:33:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不喝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No tap.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.93,0:33:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打扰一下 为什么不喝“自来水” - 水里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me, what is "tap"? - Water.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.84,0:33:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在里面放了氟化物 从纳粹那里学来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They put fluoride in it. Learned it from the Nazis.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.63,0:33:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上说 是为了让你服从 易于操控{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theory is it makes you docile, easy to manipulate.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.47,0:33:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我就喝自来水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I drink tap water.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.01,0:33:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我看出来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I kind of figured that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.55,0:33:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过她是你们的主心骨 应该没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she does the thinking for both of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.13,0:33:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以应该没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so it should be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.09,0:33:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 好的.{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.01,0:33:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有什么发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.59,0:33:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信哥斯拉最近的袭击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe Godzilla's most recent attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.55,0:33:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是巧合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}haven't just been random.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.88,0:33:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的目标就是阿派克斯工厂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he targeted the Apex facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.88,0:33:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的观点一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm of the same opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.43,0:33:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 阿派克斯到底做了什么激怒了它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why? What is Apex up to that's provoking him?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.84,0:33:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,五年来 我一直扎根于这家公司{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For five years, I embedded myself inside this company,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.47,0:33:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,试图弄清楚他们葫芦里卖的什么药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to figure out what their game was.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.63,0:33:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 上周…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, last week…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.22,0:33:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.63,0:33:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一份从这里寄出的巨型货物的舱单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A manifest of huge cargo being sent from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.80,0:33:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,发往香港的阿派克斯总部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Apex headquarters in Hong Kong,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.84,0:33:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没有任何意义{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.76,0:33:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们没有大型运输设备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we are not equipped for heavy shipping.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.68,0:33:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后呢 - 然后就砰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then what? - And then boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.01,0:33:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉出现了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godzilla shows up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.80,0:33:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,半个工厂坍塌了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caved in half the facility,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.50,0:33:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我偷看了一些可疑的技术{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I got a sneak peek at some suspicious tech.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.13,0:33:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,它藏在一个秘密的地堡里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which was hidden in a secret bunker.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.80,0:33:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 一些非常可疑的技术{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, some pretty damn suspicious tech.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.84,0:34:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但那是什么呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.01,0:34:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是 嗯…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.84,0:34:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是katzunari麦芽威士忌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Katzunari single malt whiskey.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.26,0:34:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但这装在枪套里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but it's in a gun holster.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.63,0:34:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的莎拉送给我的礼物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a gift from my Sara.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.72,0:34:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的莎拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a Sara?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.88,0:34:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我的妻子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.51,0:34:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 她去世了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, she passed on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.18,0:34:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我的精神支柱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was my rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.26,0:34:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的真理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.84,0:34:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要告诉你们 什么时候这里空了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you something, the day that this goes empty,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.43,0:34:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我放弃的那一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's the day you know I've given up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.59,0:34:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bernie.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.84,0:34:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们可以互相帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we can help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.97,0:34:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我想现在我们是一个团队了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I guess now that we're a team,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.55,0:34:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该有一个计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like we should come up with a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.01,0:34:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要闯入阿派克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're breaking into Apex.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.38,0:34:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 什么 - 你听到她说的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, what? - You heard her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.59,0:34:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别喝自来水了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tap water.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.38,0:34:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.63,0:35:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.70,0:35:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.80,0:35:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我一直试着跟他沟通
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.10,0:35:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,去了解它
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.50,0:35:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,金刚不想让你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.90,0:35:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.20,0:35:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 所有人都知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.84,0:36:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.84,0:36:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.38,0:36:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,很安静 安静得让担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm. So calm, it's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.47,0:36:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是非同寻常{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.63,0:36:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在用手势比划字母 发出基本指令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been signing the alphabet. Basic commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.47,0:36:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为他会认识 但他从来没有…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that he showed recognition, but he never…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.09,0:36:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道她们沟通多久了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea how long they've been communicating?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.09,0:36:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.47,0:36:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和它确实有牵绊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew that they had a bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.68,0:36:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,它信任她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He trusts her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.22,0:36:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没有她 这条船早就四分五裂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without her, he'd be tearing the ship apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.97,0:36:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 吉雅的父母都死在了骷髅岛上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Jia's parents were killed on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.84,0:36:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,风暴席卷骷髅岛时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the storm took over the island,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.51,0:36:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,当地土著无一幸免{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it wiped out the native people.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.84,0:36:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是金刚救了她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Kong saved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.80,0:36:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她无处可去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had nowhere to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.97,0:36:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我做出了承诺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I made a promise,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.47,0:36:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在那里 来保护她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then and there, to protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.05,0:36:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得它也在做同样的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think that in some way, he did the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.93,0:37:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为它会听从她的指示吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think he would take directions from her?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.68,0:37:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.09,0:37:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们有人能控制金刚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we have someone who can keep the reins on Kong…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.84,0:37:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没有人能控制金刚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no one can keep the reins on Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.47,0:37:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还只是个孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she's a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.13,0:37:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道吉雅只是个孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know Jia is only a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.55,0:37:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她是金刚唯一愿意交流的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she's the only one he'll communicate with.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.55,0:37:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要金刚找到那个能量源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we need Kong to find that power source.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.22,0:37:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界需要它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world needs him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.84,0:38:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's she saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.09,0:38:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godzilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.84,0:38:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们改变航向了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we change course?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.26,0:38:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我们离你标出的区域很远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We're nowhere near the areas you flagged.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.13,0:38:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是冲我们来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like he's coming for us anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.13,0:38:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是冲我们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.43,0:38:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲它？那就扔了它 把那猴子扔了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him? Then dump him. Dump the monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.80,0:38:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如我们把你扔掉怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about we throw you off instead, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.01,0:38:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得放了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to release him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.26,0:38:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有了金刚 任务就失败了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we lose Kong, the mission is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.84,0:38:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是坐以待毙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a sitting duck out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.22,0:38:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得让他保护自己 还有我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to let him protect himself. And us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.84,0:40:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪 吉雅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, Jia!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.18,0:40:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,内森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nathan?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.43,0:44:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,它需要帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.80,0:44:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有办法让哥斯拉转移注意力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There must be some way to disorient Godzilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.93,0:44:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,深水炸弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Depth charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.51,0:45:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他掉头回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's circling back.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.05,0:45:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非他们其中的一个认输 否则这不会结束的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This won't end until one of them submits.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.68,0:45:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 关掉那些 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut it down. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.22,0:45:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.59,0:45:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器 引擎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guns, engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.38,0:46:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 全部关掉 马上 - 如果我们照做 我们死定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut it down. Right now. - If we do that, we're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.43,0:46:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们得装死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're playing dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.22,0:46:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是让它认为它赢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're making him think that he's won.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.01,0:46:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,切断动力 关掉引擎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut the power. Cut the engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.55,0:46:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何发出噪音的都关掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill anything that makes a noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.18,0:46:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这最好管用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This better work.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.80,0:47:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.20,0:47:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.84,0:47:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一有动静 它就会回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as we move, he'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.26,0:47:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的路我们怎么走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we supposed to get the rest of the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.55,0:47:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,金刚有恐高症吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's Kong with heights?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.05,0:47:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 有什么计划呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.47,0:47:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看地下33层有什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We find out what's on Sublevel 33.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.43,0:47:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别停下来 自来水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow. Keep it moving, tap water.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.84,0:47:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.01,0:48:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 疯帽子 掉进兔子洞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Mad Hatter. Down the rabbit hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.63,0:48:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这难不倒我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. We got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.18,0:48:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.51,0:48:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定我们可以相信他吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure we can trust this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.68,0:48:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.18,0:48:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 这人除了说疯话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, mainly because he says crazy shit all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.84,0:48:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还整天揣着死去妻子送的威士忌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and carries a bottle of whiskey.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.22,0:48:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,像带着枪一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from his dead wife like a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.84,0:48:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这很浪漫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.18,0:48:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的不了解女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really don't understand women.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.59,0:48:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.22,0:48:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有东西都坍塌了 然后就有了这个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole thing came down, and there was this…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.05,0:48:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.97,0:48:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 我们在看什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what are we looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.01,0:49:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 上次就在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no. No, it was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.51,0:49:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 就在那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to God, it was… it was right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.38,0:49:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.72,0:49:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人知道这通向哪里吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone know where this leads to?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.26,0:49:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信我的 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believe me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.59,0:49:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我知道这里肯定有东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I know that there was something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.13,0:49:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个手电筒让我偏头痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get a migraine from that torch.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.05,0:49:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,下行 这东西能下到多深 伯尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sublevel." How deep does this thing go, Bernie?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.55,0:49:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱 直达地狱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell. Goes to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.84,0:49:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,33层到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sublevel 33.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.59,0:49:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,磁悬浮班车起动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maglev shuttle departure.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.26,0:49:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,九点准时发往新墨西哥州罗斯威尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Roswell, New Mexico at 0900 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.84,0:49:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.63,0:49:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.84,0:49:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是脱离世界的文明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's breakaway civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.59,0:49:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 这是就是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, come on. This is page one.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.09,0:49:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿派克斯扮演上帝手册里的第一页吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the Apex-playing-God handbook. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.93,0:49:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 光明会运作影子经济支持精英阶层{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the Illuminati running shadow economies.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.13,0:49:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,为精英们建立一个隐秘的殖民地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all to fund a hidden colony for the elite.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.47,0:49:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防政府机构{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in case any of these governments.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.43,0:49:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,或巨头财阀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and megacorporations.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.59,0:50:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,意外触动世界末日按钮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}accidentally hit the doomsday button.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.97,0:50:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来真是这么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes sense…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.22,0:50:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你仔细想想 - 好的 当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If you think about it. - Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.76,0:50:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人来了 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Someone's coming. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.01,0:50:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人来了 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Someone's coming. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.38,0:50:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人来了吗 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Someone's coming? - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.18,0:50:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.13,0:50:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这些看起来像鸡蛋 - 骷髅蜥蜴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They look like eggs. - Skull-crawlers.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.47,0:50:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿派克斯养骷髅蜥蜴做了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's Apex doing with skull-crawlers?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.97,0:50:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们先装上去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's load it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.72,0:50:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that? What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.22,0:50:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 不 不 不 赶快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way. No, no, no. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.26,0:50:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我觉得我们在动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, guys, I think we're moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.51,0:50:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面说我们目的地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says we're headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.76,0:50:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,香港阿派克斯总部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Apex headquarters in Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.84,0:50:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 香港{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.84,0:50:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着我们快找到答案了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means that we're gonna get some answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.13,0:51:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,G10 发射就绪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}G10, clear for launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.09,0:51:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出发了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.55,0:51:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're getting close!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.03,0:53:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,家
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.09,0:53:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不管用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.01,0:54:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 你先等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wait. Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.84,0:54:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她告诉它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if she tells him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.05,0:54:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面还有其他像它一样的同类呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are others down there like him?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.84,0:54:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你并不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.18,0:54:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们失去了整个舰队才到达这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost our entire fleet getting here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.68,0:54:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经没有回头路了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way back for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.84,0:54:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在这生存不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he can't survive here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.09,0:54:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.05,0:54:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.60,0:54:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉它
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.80,0:54:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能还有它的同类
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.80,0:54:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.00,0:54:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,家人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.30,0:54:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.82,0:54:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望如此
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.30,0:55:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可能有你的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.84,0:55:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,它去了 准备发射 大家各就各位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going. Prepare to launch! Everybody to their station.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.22,0:55:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.76,0:55:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有机组人员就位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All flights crews cleared.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.63,0:55:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,立即启动地底世界飞行器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for immediate HEAV launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.84,0:55:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,地飞1号在线 起飞准备就绪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}HEAV 1 online. We're clear for launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.84,0:55:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 地飞1号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that, HEAV 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.55,0:55:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,地飞2号在线 正在离开机库{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}HEAV 2 online. Exiting hangar now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.18,0:55:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,地飞2号确认 编号4055 飞行路线确认{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}HEAV 2, confirmation 4055.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.80,0:55:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是地飞3号 正在起飞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is HEAV 3 online, launching now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.22,0:55:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟随前机飞行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll follow him from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.47,0:56:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.13,0:56:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.84,0:56:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定这只猴子能活下来吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure the monkey's gonna survive this?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.26,0:56:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 它没问题 你该担心的是我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he'll be fine. It's us I'd worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.68,0:56:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要在两秒内飙出一千英里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're about to be launched 1, 000 miles in two seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.88,0:56:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到重力完全反转 我们进行自由落体运动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}until gravity inverts itself and spits us into free fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.63,0:56:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会让你大开眼界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be the most amazing thing you've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.84,0:56:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,给 呕吐用的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. For the vomit.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.84,0:56:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.68,0:58:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,引擎故障 重力过低{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engine failure, gravity low.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.09,0:58:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,引擎故障{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engine failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.84,0:58:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体启动反重力推进系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All Delta, reverse gravity propulsion!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.68,0:59:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太美了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.93,0:59:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是地飞3号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is HEAV 3,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.47,0:59:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们收到一些奇怪的雷达活动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're getting some strange radar activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.63,0:59:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要绕过去…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna circle back and…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.72,1:00:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体注意 准备发动攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All Delta, prepare to attack!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.59,1:01:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是恶心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's gross.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.68,1:01:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,金刚上路了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kong's on the move.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.97,1:01:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.76,1:01:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 他似乎知道他要去哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he seems to know where he's going.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.63,1:01:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你看它跑得多快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he certainly can move.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.43,1:03:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.84,1:03:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西正在减速{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creepy monorail is slowing down.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.84,1:03:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,请注意 货运舱即将到达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention: Shipping pod arriving.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.93,1:03:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 别出声 跟着我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Keep quiet. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.63,1:03:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,要进去吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going in?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.84,1:03:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.59,1:03:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.93,1:04:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,老这样 我发誓 这门恨我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time, I swear. Doors hate us.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.38,1:04:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.80,1:04:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 哦 我的天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aah! - Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.09,1:04:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,它实在是太大了 这太蠢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just so massive. It's so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.59,1:04:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是什么地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what is this place?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.84,1:04:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果企业为了美化它 用术语来形容 这叫献祭坑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if there's a corporate-friendly term for "sacrifice pit, "
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.55,1:04:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就在这里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say we are in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.97,1:04:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪 太臭了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, that stinks.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.84,1:04:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不妙 伯尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not good. Bernie!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.51,1:04:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌这个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really hate this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.88,1:04:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意：演示{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention: Demonstration.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.18,1:04:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在倒计时一分钟后开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in T-minus one minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.43,1:04:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人员远离演示区域{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All personnel are to stay clear of the area.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.80,1:05:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,西蒙斯先生 系统即将上线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Simmons, systems are coming online now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.97,1:05:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始上行连接{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commence uplink.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.51,1:05:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,接通上行链路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engaging uplink.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.84,1:05:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾驶员已连接{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pilot engaged.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.59,1:06:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是机器人哥斯拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's robot Godzilla.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.72,1:06:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不 准确的说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. That's…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.47,1:06:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那叫机械哥斯拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Mechagodzilla.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.09,1:06:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,10号门开启{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release number 10.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.59,1:06:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go! Go through there!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.97,1:06:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅蒂森 快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madison! Run, girl!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.84,1:07:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.38,1:07:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.51,1:07:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,系统仅达到40%的功率{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}System only reached 40% power.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.18,1:07:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.84,1:07:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不出所料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As expected.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.68,1:07:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 一旦进入地底世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. Once the Hollow Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.26,1:07:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,上传完成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}sample is uploaded,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.93,1:07:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的能源问题就会解决{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}our power troubles will be over.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.13,1:07:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,前提他们能找到源头的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they can find the source.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.05,1:07:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 肯定会找到的 我对我女儿有信心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they'll find it. I have faith in my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.18,1:07:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,也对我们的创造有信心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have faith in our creation.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.51,1:07:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类将再次…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And humanity will once again…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.55,1:07:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为最顶尖的物种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}be the apex species.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.97,1:08:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是哥斯拉袭击阿派克斯的原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is why Godzilla attacked the Apex facility.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.01,1:08:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想要取代他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're trying to replace him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.84,1:08:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 麦迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Maddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.42,1:08:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 哥斯拉突然改变了方向{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, Godzilla just made an abrupt change.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.42,1:08:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且移速很快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in direction. He's moving very fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.13,1:08:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,预测显示他可能去香港{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Projections show he's likely headed to Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.55,1:08:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,运输机随时准备带您去现场 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transport is ready and waiting to take you there, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.72,1:09:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定就是这了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That has to be it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.22,1:11:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were right.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.05,1:11:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,它到家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's home.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.13,1:12:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人员必须{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All personnel must display.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.97,1:12:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩戴阿派克斯员工证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}their Apex employee badge at all times.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.93,1:12:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.09,1:12:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿派克斯的建筑布局都一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizard people build all their facilities.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.88,1:12:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样的 我能找到出口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the same way. I can find the exit.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.01,1:12:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,出口在这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The exit's this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.13,1:12:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 梅蒂森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys. Madison!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.05,1:13:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.18,1:13:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,贱人 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch, what?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.68,1:13:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个泰坦头骨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Titan skull.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.22,1:13:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不是普通的泰坦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. That's not just any Titan.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.51,1:13:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是零号怪兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Monster Zero.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.09,1:13:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,基多拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghidorah.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.84,1:13:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们硬件化了它的DNA{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They hardwired its DNA.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.84,1:13:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些发光的自生神经通路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Self-generating neural pathways.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.93,1:13:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,让其拥有直觉学习能力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}capable of intuitive learning.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.13,1:13:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我虽然聪明 可我还在中学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm smart, but I only go to high school.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.84,1:13:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是个活的超级电脑 - 嘘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a living supercomputer. - Shh.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.68,1:13:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有三个头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had three heads.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.05,1:13:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的脖子太长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its necks were so long,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.84,1:13:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑袋能过感应进行交流{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they communicated telepathically.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.68,1:13:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's one here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.13,1:13:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个在那东西里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and another one inside of that thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.09,1:13:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 这可能是个灵能接口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it could be a psionic interface.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.22,1:13:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.55,1:13:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.84,1:13:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是驾驶员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a pilot.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.01,1:13:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 他在催眠状态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. He's in a trance.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.84,1:13:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是灵能通联{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a psionic uplink.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.38,1:14:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会遵循他的意愿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It follows his will.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.88,1:14:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 阿派克斯 你们做了些什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Apex, what have you done?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.93,1:14:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,最担心的还是发生了 我已经下了命令 博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the day we feared. I've given the order, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.13,1:14:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,城里的人正在疏散中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The city is being evacuated.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.05,1:15:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白 他把我们带到了这里 可能量源呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand. He led us here. Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.47,1:15:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.47,1:15:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个斧头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the axe.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.97,1:15:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,它从核中吸收辐射{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's drawing radiation from the core.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.97,1:15:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像充电一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}like it's charging.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.84,1:16:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦 哥斯拉在回应了 他们找到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Godzilla's responding! They found it!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.84,1:16:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.22,1:17:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.93,1:17:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,提取样本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extracting a sample.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.76,1:17:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一种超出我们理解的能量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a power beyond our understanding.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.05,1:17:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能这么随便提取{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just drill into it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.72,1:17:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么不可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, we can.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.43,1:17:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲得到了他想要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father gets what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.55,1:17:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这现在属于阿派克斯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Apex property now.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.84,1:17:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.18,1:17:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有能量信号进来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Energy signature incoming.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.76,1:17:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很快就能重建这种能量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be able to recreate it soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.68,1:17:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是超越千年的发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the discovery of the millennium.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.05,1:17:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不能被你搞得支离破碎 - 等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can't strip it for parts. - Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.47,1:18:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走 拿到我们需要的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Go. Got what we needed.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.63,1:18:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.84,1:18:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.22,1:18:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,芹泽先生 启动你的引擎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Serizawa, start your engines!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.80,1:18:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个升级还未经测试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The upgrade is untested.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.13,1:18:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦我们启动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we get online,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.68,1:18:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉会直奔我们而来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gojira will come straight for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.43,1:18:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直在找我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.09,1:18:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然我们的造物主开始觉醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}since our creation first awoke.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.13,1:18:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们必须应战 - 我们不应该操之过急{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We must embrace it. - We shouldn't rush this.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.55,1:18:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道这种能量源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no idea how this energy source.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.76,1:18:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,会对机械哥斯拉有什么影响{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will affect the Mecha.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.88,1:18:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐到该死的椅子上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the goddamn chair.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.84,1:18:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快 快 快 - 快点 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go, go, go! - Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.63,1:18:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在等什么起飞 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! What are you waiting for? Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.51,1:19:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 这边 快 我们得赶快回…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, sir! Hurry! We gotta get back…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.01,1:19:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.18,1:20:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快让它躲开 开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him out of the way! Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.84,1:20:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走 走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.88,1:20:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.72,1:20:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.76,1:20:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪 快点 我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jesus! Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.97,1:21:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坐稳 女士们 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold on, ladies. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.18,1:21:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.43,1:21:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,门已锁定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay low.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.68,1:21:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 肯定火了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Going viral.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.63,1:21:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.80,1:21:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得阻止它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've gotta try and stop this.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.76,1:21:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯-嗯 我不喜欢这个氛围 伙计们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-mm. I don't like this, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.72,1:21:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是用来毁灭世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this wasn't contributing to world destruction,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.76,1:21:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这将会是不错的打碟台{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this would be a great DJ booth.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.51,1:21:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来维护设备的… 维修工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what it… Maintenance.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.93,1:21:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅蒂森 我们该走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madison, we should go.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.59,1:21:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是维护人员 不用报警…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Maintenance. You don't have to alert the…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.84,1:21:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会相信的 梅蒂森 我们快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't buy that. Uh, Madison, we need to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.01,1:22:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个留着女魔头发型的女人在叫保安…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The woman with the villain hairdo…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.01,1:22:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅蒂森 他们有枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madison, they have guns.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.55,1:22:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计们 呃 这屋是隔音的 所以我听不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys. Uh, it's soundproof so I can't really…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.84,1:22:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也想和你们谈谈… - 开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wanna communicate… - Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.43,1:22:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say again?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.59,1:22:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝 趴下 趴下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God! Get down! Get down!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.38,1:22:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.84,1:24:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就要到地表了 抓紧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're about to breach the veil! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.72,1:26:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二回合是金刚赢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like round two goes to Kong.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.80,1:26:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.97,1:26:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 别这样 伙计们 真的吗 又是绿色和平组织{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, guys. Really? Greenpeace again?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.68,1:26:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿色和平…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greenpea…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.72,1:26:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 先生 你不太可能知道这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, sir, not like you would know this,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.01,1:26:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我是二级助理工程师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm Level Two Assistant Engineering…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.93,1:26:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,临时二级助理工程师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Provisional Level Two Assistant Engineering,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.47,1:26:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not like you would know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.84,1:26:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的工作表现可是非常优秀的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My evaluations were incredibly encourag…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.88,1:26:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿色 和平 配不上我的 这就是我要说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying Greenpeace wishes, is all I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.18,1:26:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪里见过你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do I know you from?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.51,1:26:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my goodness.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.80,1:26:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗素主任的女儿 对吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Director Russell's daughter, yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.05,1:26:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都是你造成的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You caused all of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.72,1:27:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你的意思“这一切” 我一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If by "all of this, " you mean I, and I alone,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.01,1:27:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,给了人类对抗泰坦的机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}have given humanity a chance against the Titans,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.68,1:27:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 是的 确实是在下的功劳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then, yes, I will own that title.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.68,1:27:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉没有挑起战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godzilla had left us in peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.18,1:27:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你把战争强加给它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You provoked him into war.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.01,1:27:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,一山不容二虎 罗素小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There can only be one alpha, Miss Russell.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.84,1:27:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这似乎是天意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems to have been providence.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.38,1:30:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,该行动了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.18,1:30:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始驾驶员整合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Begin pilot integration.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.18,1:30:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.59,1:30:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的机械哥斯拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}my Mecha.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.18,1:30:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不是哥斯拉的复制品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not only Godzilla's equal…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.59,1:30:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,它更强大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but his superior.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.38,1:30:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,凝聚了我心血的阿派克斯巨兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Apex Titan of my own hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.76,1:30:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候向世界展示你的实力了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to show the world what you can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.09,1:30:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾驶员已连接{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pilot engaged.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.00,1:30:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告：中央处理器被覆写{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alert: Failure. System unstable.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.13,1:30:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,故障 系统运行不稳定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Failure. System unstable.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.38,1:31:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们作为一个物种就要这样取胜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how we, as a species, win.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.13,1:31:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在十年前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, 10 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.01,1:31:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,当哥斯拉第一次披露给世界时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when Gojira was first revealed to the world,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.72,1:31:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了一个梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.93,1:31:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那个梦里 我看到了一个东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in that dream, I saw one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.09,1:31:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个美丽 令人惊叹的东西 就是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that beautiful, amazing thing was…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.93,1:31:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 见鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.18,1:31:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.84,1:31:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不公平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's unfair.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.22,1:31:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的很想听完那个演讲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really wanted to hear the rest of that speech.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.80,1:32:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 那到底是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in God's name is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.38,1:33:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,它现在有了自己的思想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's thinking for itself now.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.84,1:33:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要提醒帝王组织{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to warn Monarch.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.01,1:33:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,试着阻止它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or try to stop it ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.59,1:33:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西连接着他们的卫星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing's still linked to their satellite.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.38,1:33:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 乔什{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Josh.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.47,1:33:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能找到密码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can figure out the password,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.55,1:33:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许可以关掉它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe we can shut it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.38,1:33:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.22,1:33:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.59,1:34:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.00,1:34:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的心跳越来越慢
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.68,1:34:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.68,1:34:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她能感觉到它的心跳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can feel his heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.13,1:34:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.63,1:34:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无法重新让它恢复心跳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing we can do to restart his heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.80,1:34:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非能找到一种能量强大到足以…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd need a charge big enough to…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.84,1:34:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,让拉斯维加斯亮一周{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Light up Las Vegas for a week.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.84,1:35:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是密码吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a password?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.26,1:35:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是密码吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a password?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.59,1:35:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我不擅长这种事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know! I'm not used to this.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.93,1:35:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只擅长在网上下载盗版电影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm used to pirating movies online.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.59,1:35:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 转到设置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, then go to Settings.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.18,1:35:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是马克 - 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is Mark. - Dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.76,1:35:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅蒂森 你在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madison, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.80,1:35:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 你能听到吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, can you hear…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.05,1:35:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听得见吗 我在香港{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me? I'm in Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.93,1:35:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 梅蒂 - 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mad? - Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.51,1:35:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅蒂 梅蒂森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mad? Madison!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.01,1:35:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-ha!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.59,1:35:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 你们最好离远点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you two better get some distance.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.84,1:35:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.84,1:35:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个非常勇敢的小女孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a very brave little girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.97,1:36:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.43,1:36:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们都是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we both are.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.72,1:36:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.90,1:36:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运 大家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, big fella.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.60,1:37:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉不是敌人
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.80,1:37:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个才是敌人
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.40,1:37:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.80,1:37:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,请…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.00,1:38:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.72,1:38:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你说过你是个黑客{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said you were a hacker!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.22,1:38:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说我在夏令营上过HTML课程{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I took an HTML course at summer camp.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.18,1:38:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- HTML - 是的 在夏令营{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- HTML? - Yes, at summer camp.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.84,1:38:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,上世纪的夏令营 拜托 用标准键盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it a '90s camp? Come on. Use QWERTY.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.84,1:38:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,错误 安全锁已开启{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Error. Security lock.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.68,1:38:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.18,1:38:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.No.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.22,1:40:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔什 你一定得做点什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Josh! You have to do something.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.05,1:40:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们试着撂倒那些阿派克斯的混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We tried to take down those Apex bastards,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.13,1:40:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想也只能做到这一步了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I think this is as far as we go,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.63,1:40:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以干杯吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so bottom's up.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.97,1:40:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来想和大人物一起死的 不过没关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hoping to die with adults, but okay.
